<title>RUSSIA: Mosenergo up 12 percent in bullish Moscow.</title>
<headline>Mosenergo up 12 percent in bullish Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moscow regional utility Mosenergo was traded at $1.42 at 0944 GMT on the Russian Trading System, up over 12 percent on Thursday's closing $1.26.</p>
<p>Many foreign investors treat Mosenergo as a proxy for the whole Russian market, where leading shares continued to rally on Friday, advancing from Thursday's record.</p>
<p>--Jonathan Lynn, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
